    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Beertii Naabood Ee Canabka Ahayd",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxyaalahaas dabadood waxay noqotay in Naabood oo ahaa reer Yesreceel uu lahaa beer canab ah oo Yesreceel ku tiil ee uu dhowayd gurigii Axaab oo ahaa boqorkii Samaariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Axaab baa Naabood la hadlay, oo ku yidhi, Beertaada canabka ah i sii aan beer khudrad ah ka dhigtee, maxaa yeelay, waxay u dhow dahay gurigayga, oo adigana waxaan ku siinayaa beer canab ah oo iyada ka sii wanaagsan, amase haddii ay kula wanaagsan tahay, waxaan ku siinayaa qiimeheeda oo lacag ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Naabood wuxuu Axaab ku yidhi, Ilaah ha iga hayo inaan dhaxalkii awowayaashay ku siiyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Axaab wuxuu yimid gurigiisii isagoo calool xun oo ka xanaaqsan eraygii Naabood kii reer Yesreceel isaga kula hadlay; maxaa yeelay, wuxuu isaga ku yidhi, Ku siin maayo dhaxalkii awowayaashay. Markaasuu sariirtiisii jiifsaday, wuuna sii jeestay, oo diiday inuu wax cuno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse naagtiisii Yesebeel ayaa u timid oo waxay ku tidhi, War maxaa naftaadu u qulubsan tahay oo aad kibis la cuni weyday? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu iyadii ku yidhi, Naa waxaan la hadlay Naabood kii reer Yesreceel, oo aan ku idhi, Beertaada canabka ah lacag iga siiso, ama haddii kale oo ay kula wanaagsan tahay waxaan kaa siisanayaa beer kale oo canab ah, oo isna wuxuu iigu jawaabay, Beertayda ku siin maayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa naagtiisii Yesebeel waxay ku tidhi, War miyaadan haatan u talin boqortooyada Israa'iil? Haddaba kac oo wax cun, oo qalbigaagana ka farxi; anigaa ku siinaya Naabood ka reer Yesreceel beertiisa canabka ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed warqado ayay ku qortay Axaab magiciisii oo waxay ku shaabadaysay shaabaddiisii. Oo waxay warqadihii u dirtay odayaashii iyo kuwii gobta ahaa ee magaaladiisii Naabood la degganaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay warqadaha ku qortay oo ku tidhi, War waxaad naadisaan oo tidhaahdaan, Ha la soomo; oo Naaboodna dadka ka sarraysiiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo hortiisana waxaad fadhiisisaan laba nin oo waxmatarayaal ah, oo iyana isaga ha ku marag fureen, oo ha ku yidhaahdeen, Adigu waxaad cayday Ilaah iyo boqorka. Markaas isaga dibadda u bixiya oo dhagaxyo la dhaca si uu u dhinto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadkii magaaladiisii la degganaa ee ahaa odayaashii iyo kuwii gobta ahaa waxay yeeleen sidii Yesebeel u soo fartay oo ahayd sidii ku qornayd warqadihii ay iyaga u dirtay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxay naadiyeen oo yidhaahdeen, Ha la soomo, oo Naaboodna ayay dadka ka sarraysiiyeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaa yimid oo hortiisa fadhiistay laba nin oo waxmatarayaal ah, markaasaa waxmatarayaashii Naabood ku marag fureen dadka hortiisii, oo waxay yidhaahdeen, Naabood wuxuu caayay Ilaah iyo boqorkaba. Markaasay isagii magaaladii ka saareen, oo waxay la dhaceen dhagaxyo, wuuna dhintay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay Yesebeel farriin u direen oo waxay ku yidhaahdeen, Naabood waa la dhagxiyey, wuuna dhintay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markii Yesebeel ay maqashay in Naabood la dhagxiyey oo uu dhintay, ayay Yesebeel Axaab ku tidhi, War kac oo iska qaado beertii canabka ahayd oo Naabood kii reer Yesreceel ee uu hore inuu lacag kaa siisto kuugu diiday; waayo, haatan Naabood ma noola, wuuse dhintay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markii Axaab maqlay in Naabood dhintay ayaa Axaab wuxuu u kacay inuu u dhaadhaco oo iska qaato beertii Naabood kii reer Yesreceel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Eraygii Rabbiga ayaa u yimid Eliiyaah kii reer Tishbii, isagoo leh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "War sara joogso, oo u dhaadhac boqorka dalka Israa'iil oo Axaab ah oo Samaariya deggan; oo bal eeg, wuxuu ku dhex jiraa beertii canabka ahayd oo Naabood, halkaasoo uu ugu dhaadhacay inuu iska qaato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waa inaad isaga la hadashaa, oo waxaad ku tidhaahdaa, Rabbigu wuxuu kugu leeyahay, War ma wax baad dishay, oo haddana ma wax baad qaadatay? Oo haddana isaga waxaad ku tidhaahdaa, Rabbigu wuxuu kugu leeyahay, Meeshii eeyuhu ka leefleefeen dhiiggii Naabood ayaa adiga dhiiggaagana eeyo ka leefleefi doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Axaab wuxuu ku yidhi Eliiyaah, Cadowgaygiiyow, haddana ma i heshay? Oo isna wuxuu ugu jawaabay, Haah, waan ku helay, maxaa yeelay, waxaad isu iibisay inaad Rabbiga hortiisa wax shar ah ku samayso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo bal ogow, Axaabow, belaayo baan kugu soo dejin doonaa, oo farcankaaga waan kaa qaadi doonaa, oo waxaan kaa baabbi'in doonaa wiil kasta, ha ahaado mid kasta oo dalka Israa'iil ku dhex xidhan ama mid kasta oo ku dhex furan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo reerkaagana waxaan ka dhigi doonaa sidii reerkii Yaaraabcaam ina Nebaad iyo sidii reerkii Bacshaa ina Axiiyaah, sababtuna waxa weeye xanaaqii aad iga xanaajisay oo aad dadkii Israa'iilna dembaajisay aawadiis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yesebeelna Rabbigu wuu ka hadlay oo yidhi, Yesebeel eeyuhu waa ku cuni doonaan derbiga Yesreceel agtiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Axaab dadkiisa kii magaalada kaga dhinta waxaa cuni doona eeyaha; oo kii duurka kaga dhintana waxaa cuni doona haadka samada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Laakiinse lama arag qof Axaab la mid ah oo isu iibiyey inuu sameeyo wax Rabbiga hortiisa shar ku ah, kaasoo ay kicisay naagtiisii Yesebeel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wax aad karaahiyo u ah ayuu sameeyey markuu sanamyo raacay oo uu u wada sameeyey siday sameeyeen reer Amor kii Rabbigu ka tuuray dadka Israa'iil hortooda.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkii Axaab erayadaas maqlay ayuu dharkiisii jeexjeexay, oo joonyado guntaday, wuuna soomay, oo joonyado ku dhex seexday, oo aayar u socday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana eraygii Rabbigu wuxuu u yimid Eliiyaah kii reer Tishbii oo ku yidhi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "War sow uma jeeddid siduu Axaab hortayda isugu hoosaysiiyey? Sharka ku soo dejin maayo intuu isagu nool yahay, maxaa yeelay, isagu hortayduu isku hoosaysiiyey; laakiinse sharka waxaan reerkiisa ku soo dejin doonaa wakhtiga wiilkiisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
